  "body": "## What's Changed\n* proxy: v2.367.0 by @l5d-bot in https://github.com/linkerd/linkerd2/pull/15612\n* fix(multicluster): disallow exec auth provider in remote credentials by @adleong in https://github.com/linkerd/linkerd2/pull/15625\n* fix(destination): return retry-able error on ip conflict by @raykroeker in https://github.com/linkerd/linkerd2/pull/15627\n* proxy: v2.368.0 by @l5d-bot in https://github.com/linkerd/linkerd2/pull/15629\n* build(deps): bump github.com/nsf/termbox-go from 1.1.1 to 1.1.2 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/linkerd/linkerd2/pull/15601\n* build(deps): bump google.golang.org/grpc from 1.83.0 to 1.83.2 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/linkerd/linkerd2/pull/15603\n* build(deps): bump regex-automata from 0.4.16 to 0.4.18 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/linkerd/linkerd2/pull/15604\n* build(deps): bump rustls from 0.23.42 to 0.23.43 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/linkerd/linkerd2/pull/15605\n* build(deps): bump zerocopy from 0.8.55 to 0.8.56 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/linkerd/linkerd2/pull/15606\n* build(deps): bump enum-ordinalize from 4.4.1 to 4.4.2 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/linkerd/linkerd2/pull/15607\n* build(deps-dev): bump webpack from 5.109.2 to 5.110.0 in /web/app by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/linkerd/linkerd2/pull/15620\n* build(deps): bump the kube group across 1 directory with 7 updates by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/linkerd/linkerd2/pull/15622\n* build(deps): bump softprops/action-gh-release from 3.0.2 to 3.0.3 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/linkerd/linkerd2/pull/15626\n* build(deps): bump browserslist from 4.28.1 to 4.28.8 in /web/app by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/linkerd/linkerd2/pull/15630\n* build(deps): bump docker/setup-qemu-action from 4.2.0 to 4.3.0 in /.github/actions/docker-build by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/linkerd/linkerd2/pull/15631\n* build(deps-dev): bump webpack-bundle-analyzer from 5.3.1 to 5.3.2 in /web/app by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/linkerd/linkerd2/pull/15621\n* build(deps): bump github.com/sirupsen/logrus from 1.10.0 to 1.10.1 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/linkerd/linkerd2/pull/15602\n* build(deps): bump cc from 1.4.0 to 1.4.4 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/linkerd/linkerd2/pull/15608\n* build(deps): bump github.com/go-openapi/spec from 0.22.9 to 1.0.0 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/linkerd/linkerd2/pull/15616\n* chore: move katelyn martin to emeriti by @cratelyn in https://github.com/linkerd/linkerd2/pull/15624\n\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/linkerd/linkerd2/compare/edge-26.8.4...edge-26.9.1",
